1
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:37,400
It's easy to save him.
I'll do it on one condition

2
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,800
What is it?

3
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:45,400
I'm currently experimenting
an obedience spell

4
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:49,600
Will you be my guinea pig?

5
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,800
Sure!

6
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,400
No regrets?

7
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:03,400
All right, you may go

8
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,400
He's fine too

9
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,800
Shou!

10
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,800
Shou!

11
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,800
Are you all right?

12
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:24,800
My neck still aches, that's all

13
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:29,600
The Deity of Medicine said a life for
a life. I thought I'd die for sure

14
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:35,600
You shouldn't have wanted to
give up your life for my looks

15
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:40,400
I may not be a hero,
but I'm a man who keeps my word

16
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:43,400
I promised to cure you, so I should

17
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,800
But I don't understand

18
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:50,400
Why did the Deity of Medicine decide
to put my head back on my body?

19
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,400
Everything's all right now.
Let's go

20
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,800
Why do I feel so light?

21
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,800
Energy is surging in me!

22
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:08,800
I know why. It must be the doing
of the Deity of Medicine

23
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,800
Isn't this a blessing in disguise?

24
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,800
Terrific!

25
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:17,800
Thank you, Deity of Medicine!
Goodbye!

26
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,400
Ma-gu, don't forget your promise!

27
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:27,800
-Can't bear to leave?
-No. Come on

28
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,200
Goodbye!

29
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,400
Who is it?

30
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,800
Shuangxi

31
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:40,400
-What brings you here, Auntie?
-I've brought you some food

32
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:43,400
Please come in

33
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:49,800
I know that rascal has made you angry
again. He shouldn't have gambled!

34
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,400
Did he ask you to come?

35
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:58,800
No... Shi Yaoqian beat him up two days
ago. He's still recuperating at home

36
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,600
What happened?
Is he badly injured?

37
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,600
He was beaten in the brothel...

38
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,600
He went to the brothel again?

39
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:08,400
I mean, he was beaten
while passing by the brothel

40
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,400
-So how is he now?
-He's all right

41
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:17,800
You still care a lot about him,
don't you?

42
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:23,800
He's such a letdown.
I can't possibly speak up for him

43
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:27,400
But I've punished him for you!

44
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:35,400
I was too naive to assume he'd change
for my sake and strive hard

45
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:41,400
Since childhood, he's been rather
obstinate. He never listens to anyone

46
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:44,800
But since he met you,
he's changed a lot

47
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,800
Please don't try to comfort me

48
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,800
What I said is true

49
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:54,800
Fu has far too many bad habits. He can't
possibly get out of them overnight

50
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:59,400
But I believe he's serious about you

51
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,400
Please give him another chance

52
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:06,400
Please don't push me. I really
don't feel like seeing him anymore

53
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:13,800
Fu just doesn't have
the good fortune...!

54
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:19,400
Please don't cry, Auntie

55
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:24,400
Fu can't do without you

56
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,800
He said these snacks
are your favourites

57
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:34,200
Do consider giving him another chance

58
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,800
I'll make a move

59
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,800
Please don't cry anymore, Auntie

60
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:47,800
I'd teach you tricks so you could
perform to make money for me

61
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:53,800
Aren't you mercenary. I was turned
into a monkey because of you

62
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:57,800
Yet you wanted to use me to make
money. Where's your conscience?

63
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:04,400
Well, you were already a monkey,
so you might as well make money for me

64
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,600
Women are really heartless

65
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:11,400
I guess it's been wishful thinking
on my part all along

66
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,400
Are you angry?

67
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,800
You didn't leave me
when I became pockmarked

68
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:20,800
Had I abandoned you when you turned into
a monkey, I'd have been disloyal to you

69
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:25,800
You mean you'll be loyal and true
to me? Don't go back on your word

70
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:29,600
You tricked me!

71
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,600
I'll get you for this!

72
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,800
I'm not playing anymore!
Stop it, Ruyi!

73
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:57,800
Oh no! Being under the Obedience Spell
means I have to do everything men say?

74
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,800
What happened?
Why did you become immobilized?

75
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,400
I'm fine

76
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:14,800
But you became immobilized.
Are you freezing?

77
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:19,800
It's a new skill I'm learning.
I haven't mastered it, that's why

78
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:23,400
It seems quite a formidable skill.
Teach me when you're free

79
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,400
Sure

80
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:45,400
I don't see a thing. I don't hear
a thing. I'm a man of my word!

81
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,800
I don't hear a thing...

82
00:07:55,800 --> 00:08:00,800
-I bet the bird will pee first!
-No! It'll pass motion first!

83
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:03,800
Are you trying to be
difficult with me?

84
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,800
I don't see or hear a thing!

85
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:12,800
The story-teller will take my mind
away from all the temptations

86
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:18,400
By playing for low stakes,
you can support your family

87
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:21,400
And by playing for high stakes,
you can get rich! Agreed?

88
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,800
My god!

89
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:32,400
-We found you at last, Chief!
-What is it?

90
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:35,800
There's a new gambling house
just opposite

91
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:41,800
Listen good! From today on,
don't ever talk to me about gambling!

92
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:45,800
There's a gambling house over there
where you only pay 70% of your losses!

93
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:49,800
And there's another gambling house
where you only pay half of your losses!

94
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:55,800
I must resist... Resist...
No...

95
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:58,800
Enough! I can't take it anymore!
I'll beat you to a pulp!

96
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:09,400
Don't ever talk to me about gambling!

97
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:23,800
Shuangxi, they asked me to go
with them to gamble but I refused

98
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:26,800
They always dragged me along
but not this time

99
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:30,800
If you want to gamble, just go ahead.
Don't torture yourself for my sake

100
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:38,600
My mother was right. I see
other people's flaws but not my own

101
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:44,400
I often tick Peng Datou off for gambling,
idling and not treating my mother well

102
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,800
But I'm no different from him

103
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:58,800
Luckily you gave me a few slaps
which woke me up

104
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:03,800
I really have realized my mistakes

105
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:09,800
I swear that from now on,
I'll be down-to-earth and work hard

106
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:22,800
Why did you tear the Commandments up?

107
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:28,800
I never took them seriously

108
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:35,800
If you're by my side every day
to remind me and encourage me,

109
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,800
I won't need the Commandments

110
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:40,800
Who says I want to be with you?

111
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:47,800
You know I can't do without you.
Life without you is meaningless to me

112
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,800
-No, I don't
-Yes, you do

113
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,800
Look at the state I'm in

114
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:58,800
It's inconvenient for me
to wash my hands or go to the latrine

115
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,800
And nobody cooks for me.
I really need you!

116
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:07,800
-I don't know...
-Yes, you do...

117
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,800
I don't know...

118
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,800
Pretty, isn't she?

119
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,800
Lovely, isn't she?

120
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:28,800
Do you like her?
I like her even more!

121
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:56,800
The snow here is whiter
than anywhere else!

122
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,400
You're right!

123
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:06,800
I'm really happy! You've been cured,
and I've become as strong as an ox!

124
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:10,800
Nobody will dare bully you again

125
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,600
That's right.
I'll protect you!

126
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:14,800
You?

127
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:15,800
Robbery!

128
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:18,600
Give us your money...

129
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,800
-Aren't you Dafu?
-Aren't you Erfu?

130
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,600
-Shou-ge?
-Ruyi-jie?

131
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:26,800
Why did you become pandas,
and why are you robbing us?

132
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:32,400
Come back!

133
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:38,800
Isn't that Sanfu?
What's wrong with him?

134
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:41,400
Sanfu!

135
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:46,800
Where are you going? Why do you keep
shaking your head? I'm talking to you

136
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:48,800
He still won't stop shaking

137
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:52,400
Why did Dafu and Erfu try to rob us?

138
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,800
Stop right there!

139
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,800
It's Fu

140
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,600
Why are you blowing your top?

141
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:07,400
-You're back?
-We just got back

142
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:10,800
Thank goodness!
Ping'an Town is in chaos!

143
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,800
Everyone is stealing and robbing
to get money...

144
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:16,800
to buy the Youth-revival Pills and
the Ecstasy Pills from Shi Yaoqian!

145
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:22,400
No wonder Dafu and Erfu tried to rob us.
So they needed money for the pills!

146
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:24,400
And I saw Sanfu...

147
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,800
Don't bother to go after him!

148
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:31,400
Shi Yaoqian is too much!

149
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:37,400
We mustn't let him do evil anymore!
We must stop him!

150
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:40,800
-I came up with an idea yesterday
-What is it?

151
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,800
We'll take the cauldron back by force!

152
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:45,800
He can't make any more pills then

153
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:53,400
He's an official. If we fight him,
we'll always be the losing party

154
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:57,800
Ruyi is right. If we use force,
things will get out of hand

155
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:01,400
We'll be giving him a chance
to malign us

156
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:05,800
What do you suggest then?
We have to do something

157
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:09,800
Don't be reckless. I've got it.
We'll go and argue with him!

158
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:13,400
He'll never listen to us!

159
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,400
He won't listen to us, of course

160
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:20,400
But if we get everybody to
confront him, won't he be scared?

161
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,800
Don't beat him!

162
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:24,800
I'll go with you to protect you

163
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:28,800
No. You're a constable after all.
You can't set yourself against him

164
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:31,800
I'll come back
once everything's settled

165
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:33,400
Wait for me, Fu!

166
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,800
Come out, Shi Yaoqian!

167
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:45,400
Get Shi Yaoqian out here, now!
We must thrash things out today!

168
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:49,400
His Excellency will never come out.
Leave!

169
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:59,800
What audacity!
Get lost!

170
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,800
You're out at last, fatso!

171
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:12,400
How dare you insult me and attack
the yamen! This is an outrage!

172
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:17,800
You take possession of our properties
and produce fake drugs to make money

173
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:21,800
You have no regard for the people at all!
You're not fit to be our magistrate!

174
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:27,800
What impertinence! Get lost now
or I'll give you 50 strokes each!

175
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:32,400
Why, you...!
Seize him!

176
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:43,400
A bunch of hooligans!

177
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,800
Come out here, Shi Yaoqian!

178
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:55,800
How dare you make trouble at the
yamen! Are you tired of living?

179
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:58,800
We're trying to get justice done

180
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:03,800
But you collaborate with Shi Yaoqian
to make fake drugs to con us!

181
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:06,800
What if I make fake drugs?
It's none of your business

182
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:09,800
We'll go to higher authorities!

183
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:13,800
Wait!
Let's talk things out

184
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:18,800
We're all fellow townsmen.
Don't let things get out of hand

185
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:20,800
Give the cauldron back to us then

186
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:28,400
With regard to the cauldron, my stand
is quite close to Magistrate Shi's

187
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:32,800
We're also trying to settle
the dispute peacefully

188
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:35,800
It's very simple actually

189
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:40,400
Just stop producing fake drugs
and return the cauldron to us

190
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:45,800
That's right! Give the cauldron back
to us and we'll let the matter rest!

191
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:49,800
Why should I do your bidding?!

192
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:53,800
Let's go to higher authorities!

193
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:58,800
Everyone!
Listen to me!

194
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:03,800
Since we all have our stands,
why don't we meet halfway?

195
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:08,800
We'll stop producing all the drugs
which have side effects

196
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:11,800
But the cauldron must be
kept here with us

197
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,800
Why must you hold on to it by force?

198
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:17,800
The cauldron isn't yours. Why do you
say I hold on to it by force?

199
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:22,800
You're mobbing and insulting me.
If I report on you, you'll be sorry!

200
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:25,800
Go ahead and do that!

201
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:30,800
Don't get all worked up.
We mustn't fall out with them

202
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:34,800
Everybody knows it was Shou and Ma Ruyi
who brought the cauldron back...

203
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:36,800
from the Eastern Sea

204
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:39,400
It's only right that
you return it to him

205
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:41,400
That's right!

206
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:46,800
Since it was Mei Shouquan who found
the cauldron, it should belong to him

207
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:48,800
Give it back to me then!

208
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:53,800
But the Eastern Sea is under the
administration of the Imperial Court

209
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:59,400
Anything found there belongs to it. That
is to say, the cauldron is the Court's

210
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:04,400
Let's go straight to Her Highness!

211
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:06,800
Everybody!

212
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:12,400
It's all right that Mei Shouquan
found the cauldron in the Eastern Sea

213
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:16,800
Don't go to Her Highness.
Can't you give in a little?

214
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:18,800
How?

215
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:23,400
We'll ask His Excellency to seek
the Imperial Court's permission...

216
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:28,400
to build an altar and get
renowned doctors to make drugs

217
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:32,400
What do you think of that?
It'll benefit everybody!

218
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:36,800
Until the altar is built, the cauldron
must be kept in the yamen...

219
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:46,800
It's only temporary. For all you know,
His Majesty may let you own the cauldron

220
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,400
Let's go!

221
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:58,800
Dafu told me Shi Yaoqian is still
selling the drugs today

222
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:02,800
Didn't they promise to stop selling
the Youth-revival and Ecstasy pills?

223
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,800
Indeed they've stopped selling them

224
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:09,400
What they're selling now is
Reviving Youth and Elation pills

225
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:13,400
Just a change in name!

226
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:17,800
We failed to get the cauldron back.
They're really cunning

227
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:20,800
So I thought of a brilliant idea
last night

228
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:23,400
-What is it?
-We'll steal the cauldron!

229
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:25,800
Steal?!

230
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:34,800
Stealing is a crime. And the yamen
is heavily guarded. It won't be easy

231
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:39,800
Relax. That rat will slacken his guard
since we've reached an agreement

232
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:44,800
We'll succeed in stealing
the cauldron, I'm sure!

233
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:47,800
He has a point

234
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:50,800
You also think we should steal?

235
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:54,800
While the waters can keep a boat
afloat, they can also overturn it

236
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:57,800
If the cauldron is with us,
it'll benefit everyone

237
00:19:57,800 --> 00:20:00,800
If it's with Shi Yaoqian,
it'll be disastrous

238
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:04,800
What's more, it was you and Shou
who brought the cauldron back

239
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:08,400
We're only getting it back.
It's not stealing

240
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:13,600
That's right. It's set.
We... will keep this from Shou

241
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:15,800
And we... will take action soon

242
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:18,800
No way!
Count me out

243
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:23,400
Think of the people of our town

244
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:26,800
You must go no matter what!

245
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:27,800
All right

246
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:57,600
Shou! Where are you going?

247
00:20:57,800 --> 00:21:00,800
I need to go out, Mother

248
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:05,800
You've been running away from me.
Are you afraid of seeing me?

249
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:10,800
You're my mother.
Why would I be afraid of seeing you?

250
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:15,400
It's just that I've been
rather busy lately

251
00:21:15,800 --> 00:21:22,400
I know you're busy saving lives and
delivering people from sufferings

252
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:27,400
You really know me, Mother.
I can't hide anything from you

253
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:30,800
I'll go on my knees then!

254
00:21:32,800 --> 00:21:37,800
Why are you doing this? My life
will be shortened! Please get up!

255
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:42,400
Just tell me what you want me to do

256
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:47,800
You're the only male descendant
in our family

257
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:53,800
It's your duty to carry on our family
name, but you've yet to get married

258
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:59,800
If you have no offspring, I'll be ashamed
to see your father in the nether world

259
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:04,600
Why worry?
I never said I wouldn't get married

260
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:06,800
But you didn't say you would either

261
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:09,800
Please give me some time

262
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:13,800
I'm not in the mood to
talk about marriage at the moment

263
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:17,800
Be honest with me.
Did you have a tiff with Miss Ma?

264
00:22:17,800 --> 00:22:24,600
No. We're getting along fine.
It's purely my problem

265
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:32,800
She's a kindhearted girl.
You mustn't let her down

266
00:22:33,800 --> 00:22:38,800
Have you found out about
her family and background?

267
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:44,800
I need time to do that, Mother.
Not so soon

268
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:48,800
All right. Three days

269
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:54,800
That's too short a time.
I'll need at least a year or so

270
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:58,800
-Two weeks
-Three months?

271
00:22:59,800 --> 00:23:03,600
One month.
Don't bargain with me anymore

272
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:06,800
All right, one month it'll be

273
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:10,800
But you mustn't rush me again
within this one month

274
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:16,600
All right, my precious son!

275
00:23:17,800 --> 00:23:18,800
Mother

276
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:25,400
Go home.
I'm going out

277
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:27,400
Take care

278
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:30,800
Careful

279
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:33,800
Take care

280
00:24:04,800 --> 00:24:05,800
Go

281
00:24:12,800 --> 00:24:14,800
We'll go as planned

282
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:19,800
You distract the guards while Ma Ruyi
and I will sneak in. Understand?

283
00:24:20,800 --> 00:24:22,800
Where's your Fortune Bag?

284
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:26,800
I've been carrying it with me

285
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:31,400
Keep it well.
It'll bring you luck

286
00:24:31,800 --> 00:24:37,400
I'll go and join Ma Ruyi.
You must be careful

287
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:53,800
Oh no, they fell off

288
00:24:54,800 --> 00:24:57,400
Oh no, they fell off!

289
00:25:01,800 --> 00:25:03,400
Oh no, I feel so weak in the legs

290
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:06,800
Oh no, I feel so weak in the legs!

291
00:25:09,800 --> 00:25:13,400
Oh no, my money!

292
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:14,800
Ma Ruyi, come and help me!

293
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:19,400
Hurry, Ma Ruyi!
Come and help me!

294
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:26,600
Men! A thief!

295
00:26:26,600 --> 00:26:28,800
I knew I couldn't count on you!

296
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:03,800
Hold it!

297
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:11,800
What's the meaning of this?!

298
00:27:13,800 --> 00:27:17,800
Let me out!
I'm talking to you!

299
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:20,400
I said let me out!

300
00:27:25,800 --> 00:27:29,800
Wu Fuqi, His Excellency is here to
see you. Shouldn't you greet him?

301
00:27:29,800 --> 00:27:31,800
It's your teacher you should greet

302
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:37,600
Teacher!
How come it's you?

303
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:40,800
I'm afraid you might be lonely

304
00:27:40,800 --> 00:27:45,800
So I got your teacher here to be
with you. It's a reunion

305
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:47,400
I'll kill you!

306
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:53,400
You ganged up with Golden Swallow
on me! I'll kill you!

307
00:27:56,800 --> 00:27:58,800
I didn't...

308
00:27:58,800 --> 00:27:59,800
Traitor!

309
00:27:59,800 --> 00:28:01,800
It's interesting!

310
00:28:05,800 --> 00:28:08,400
No, Teacher...!

311
00:28:12,800 --> 00:28:19,400
This is really fun!
Chen Daqi, aren't you brilliant!

312
00:28:19,800 --> 00:28:25,800
This will teach him
to set himself against you

313
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:30,400
Go on fighting!

314
00:28:33,800 --> 00:28:37,800
Make sure you keep a good eye on him

315
00:28:40,800 --> 00:28:43,800
I'll beat you to death!

316
00:28:43,800 --> 00:28:45,800
I really love you!

317
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:50,800
How did it go, Ma-jiejie?

318
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:55,600
How did it go?
Where's Fuqi-ge?

319
00:28:56,800 --> 00:28:58,800
Fuqi-ge!

320
00:29:02,800 --> 00:29:05,400
Why are you alone?
Where's Fuqi-ge?

321
00:29:05,800 --> 00:29:07,800
Say something!
What happened?

322
00:29:08,800 --> 00:29:14,800
Sorry, Shuangxi. Our plan failed and
Fuqi was caught. It was my fault

323
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:18,800
What are we going to do?
We must get him out!

324
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:22,800
Calm down!
We'll get him out for sure

325
00:29:22,800 --> 00:29:26,600
But we need to plan.
Nothing must go wrong this time

326
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:32,600
And do me a favour. Keep this
from Shou. I don't want him to worry

327
00:29:32,800 --> 00:29:36,600
All right.
Do you think they'll torture Fuqi-ge?

328
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:44,800
Please watch over Fuqi-ge.
See that they don't torture him...

329
00:30:15,800 --> 00:30:18,800
Fu...!

330
00:30:19,800 --> 00:30:21,800
Don't beat me anymore...

331
00:30:21,800 --> 00:30:25,600
Don't sleep anymore!

332
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:30,800
Don't beat me, Teacher!

333
00:30:33,800 --> 00:30:37,400
It's you! Get me out
before I'm beaten to death!

334
00:30:38,800 --> 00:30:39,800
Lower your voice!

335
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:43,400
-This pot of stools stinks!
-Lower your voice!

336
00:30:48,800 --> 00:30:52,800
We could've run away.
Why did you stop all of a sudden?

337
00:30:52,800 --> 00:30:55,400
I'll explain everything
when I've got you out

338
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:57,800
Open the lock!
Hurry...

339
00:30:58,800 --> 00:31:00,800
Golden Swallow!

340
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:05,800
Lower your voice.
She's here to get us out

341
00:31:05,800 --> 00:31:08,800
What nonsense!
You're trying to have me on again!

342
00:31:10,600 --> 00:31:11,600
Stop it!

343
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:15,400
You blocked my acupoint!

344
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:18,800
Beat him again and
I'll skin you alive!

345
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:23,400
Hurry! Open the lock!
Aren't you stupid!

346
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:26,800
At least I don't lie idle
or sleep in broad daylight

347
00:31:26,800 --> 00:31:28,800
If you were me, you'd sleep too!

348
00:31:33,800 --> 00:31:37,800
What do you think you're doing?
Have you fallen asleep?

349
00:31:38,800 --> 00:31:40,800
Oh please, not now!

350
00:31:40,800 --> 00:31:46,800
Get up!
Get up, Ma Ruyi! Wake up!

351
00:31:46,800 --> 00:31:48,800
What are you shouting for?

352
00:31:48,800 --> 00:31:52,400
You fell asleep! I had to wake you!
Open the lock, quick!

353
00:31:52,800 --> 00:31:54,400
Hurry!

354
00:31:56,800 --> 00:31:58,800
It's all your fault!

355
00:32:26,800 --> 00:32:27,800
Stop it!

356
00:32:31,800 --> 00:32:32,800
Shi Yaoqian

357
00:32:32,800 --> 00:32:37,800
That was quite a feat. But it's
pointless putting up a struggle

358
00:32:37,800 --> 00:32:40,800
What are you waiting for?
Get up!

359
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:43,800
What's the meaning of this?

360
00:32:44,800 --> 00:32:48,800
You tried to break into the jail to
rescue Wu Fuqi. I have to arrest you

361
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:53,600
What a joke! As a constable,
couldn't I go and see a criminal?

362
00:32:53,800 --> 00:32:55,800
Stop trying to deny it!

363
00:32:55,800 --> 00:32:59,400
Are you going to
hand me over to the authorities?

364
00:32:59,800 --> 00:33:02,800
I am the authorities

365
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:06,800
You think you can catch me?

366
00:33:06,800 --> 00:33:08,800
We'll see!

367
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:13,800
If there's nothing else,
I'll make a move

368
00:33:13,800 --> 00:33:16,800
Hold it!
I've got a friend of yours here

369
00:33:18,800 --> 00:33:20,800
Help, Ma-jiejie!

370
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:27,400
-Shuangxi! What are you doing here?
-I wanted to help you, but...

371
00:33:28,800 --> 00:33:33,600
You're a constable yet you broke
the law! Surrender yourself!

372
00:33:37,800 --> 00:33:40,800
Execute her and Wu Fuqi now!

373
00:33:40,800 --> 00:33:43,800
Please spare their lives!

374
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:50,800
Spare their lives?
I'll do that on one condition

375
00:33:51,800 --> 00:33:53,200
What is it?

376
00:33:55,800 --> 00:33:57,800
No...!

377
00:33:57,800 --> 00:34:00,800
-Behead them!
-No, Magistrate Shi!

378
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:07,800
I'll do it

379
00:34:07,800 --> 00:34:09,800
I'll be waiting for you

380
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:13,800
What did you promise him?

381
00:34:15,600 --> 00:34:17,600
Tell me!

382
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:43,800
What did that fatso say to you?

383
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:54,600
Hold it!

384
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:59,800
Be honest with me.
What happened?

385
00:35:00,800 --> 00:35:02,400
Everything's fine

386
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:07,400
You never used to lie.
What happened?

387
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:14,600
Shi Yaoqian wanted me to marry him

388
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,800
And you agreed?

389
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:22,800
Really, you shouldn't...

390
00:35:22,800 --> 00:35:27,800
What am I going to do?
I don't wish to marry him at all!

391
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,800
Please help me

392
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:33,600
I'm sorry I got you into this mess

393
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:39,400
Blame it on me for being under
the Obedience Spell

394
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:41,400
What spell did you say?

395
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:43,800
Never mind about that

396
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:48,800
I must free you from Shi Yaoqian's
clutches and get Wu Fuqi out

397
00:35:48,800 --> 00:35:50,800
What should we do?

398
00:36:03,800 --> 00:36:06,800
We'll pretend to cooperate with him

399
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:07,800
Pretend?

400
00:36:10,800 --> 00:36:12,400
Let go!

401
00:36:12,800 --> 00:36:15,800
Why couldn't we talk in the street?

402
00:36:16,800 --> 00:36:18,800
Did you try to break into the prison?

403
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:23,800
-How did you know?
-Never you mind

404
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:28,400
And why did you do Shi Yaoqian's
bidding? Why were you so stupid?

405
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:31,400
I see.
Shuangxi must've told you

406
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:35,400
So everything is true?
Why have you become like this?

407
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:37,400
Don't probe!

408
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:42,800
You must tell me!
Why have you become like this?

409
00:36:43,800 --> 00:36:47,800
In order to save you, I let the Deity
of Medicine cast a spell on me

410
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:50,800
Whoever is under the spell
will do other people's bidding

411
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:51,800
Stop

412
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:55,800
Continue

413
00:36:55,800 --> 00:37:01,400
Whoever is under the Obedience Spell
will have to do other people's bidding

414
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:02,400
Enough

415
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:08,800
So it was
the Deity of Medicine's doing

416
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:11,800
I brought it on you

417
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:15,400
You were willing to
give up your life to help me

418
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:18,400
A little sacrifice from me is nothing

419
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:22,400
One more thing. Why did you break into
the prison without telling me?

420
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:25,800
What? You broke into the prison?

421
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:26,800
Not so loud!

422
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:31,400
-How bold could you be!
-You can be beheaded for it!

423
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:36,800
Miss Ma, what's the Obedience Spell
all about?

424
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:41,800
It's rather profound, Mother.
You won't be able to understand

425
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:44,800
You won't tell us?
Ma Ruyi, you tell us!

426
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:47,800
In order to save Shou...

427
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:49,800
That's enough, Ruyi!

428
00:37:50,800 --> 00:37:52,800
Tell me, Ma Ruyi!

429
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:55,400
Ignore him, Ruyi!

430
00:37:57,800 --> 00:38:00,800
You don't have to say any more.
I've got it!

431
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:05,800
-She's gone bonkers!
-This is fun!

432
00:38:06,800 --> 00:38:09,800
Ma Ruyi, turn around and run!

433
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:14,800
Go!

434
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,800
Stop it, Ruyi

435
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:25,400
Oh no, soon everybody in Ping'an Town
will know about the spell!

436
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,800
It's all your fault!

437
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:34,800
Yes, it is. But I didn't do it on
purpose. You should blame yourself too

438
00:38:34,800 --> 00:38:37,800
Why didn't you tell me before
you broke into the prison?

439
00:38:37,800 --> 00:38:41,800
Now Shuangxi has to marry Shi Yaoqian
as a result! Isn't that worse?

440
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:46,800
Relax, that's not a bad thing.
It might to be our advantage

441
00:38:46,800 --> 00:38:51,400
You can't be serious. Shuangxi
is made to marry that rat, you know

442
00:38:51,800 --> 00:38:54,800
Hear me out.
I have a plan

443
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:59,400
We'll be able to punish Shi Yaoqian
and get Fuqi out

444
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:02,800
-Really?
-Yes

445
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:08,800
Stop

446
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:10,800
Continue

447
00:39:11,800 --> 00:39:12,800
Stop

448
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:15,800
This is interesting.
Continue

449
00:40:26,800 --> 00:40:31,800
Here I am, my dear bride.
Let me have a kiss...

450
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:35,800
Don't touch me!

451
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:39,400
Let me have a kiss, my dear...

452
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:45,600
I'm already here.
What about your promise to me?

453
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:49,800
All right, I'll do it now

454
00:40:49,800 --> 00:40:50,800
Men!

455
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:56,400
Set Wu Fuqi free

456
00:40:56,800 --> 00:41:00,400
And stay as far away as you can.
Don't get in my way!

457
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,400
Get lost!

458
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:09,800
I've kept my promise.
What about your promise to me?

459
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:11,800
Let me have a kiss...

460
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:18,400
To thank you for letting Fuqi-ge go,
I'll offer you a toast

461
00:41:22,800 --> 00:41:25,400
All right, I'll drink it up

462
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:30,800
Let me have a kiss!

463
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:35,800
Hold it!
Let me offer you another toast

464
00:41:44,800 --> 00:41:46,800
-Move!
-What is it now?

465
00:41:48,800 --> 00:41:51,800
I like it inside!
Why did you let me out?

466
00:41:51,800 --> 00:41:53,400
What nonsense!

467
00:41:53,800 --> 00:41:59,400
You're just a warder. Don't ever let me
see you again or I'll beat you up!

468
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:08,400
How dare you kick me! Come out and
take me on if you have the guts!

469
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:10,400
Don't pull me!

470
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:14,800
-Why did they set me free?
-Let's get out of here first!

471
00:42:16,800 --> 00:42:18,800
Stay where you are!

472
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:23,800
I've been running for hours.
I can't go on anymore...

473
00:42:26,800 --> 00:42:29,800
My dear...

474
00:42:33,800 --> 00:42:36,800
I can't go on anymore...

475
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:40,400
No, you must have another cup

476
00:42:40,400 --> 00:42:43,400
Not again.
I've had 18 cups!

477
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:45,400
Drink it or I'll get angry!

478
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:54,800
I have a stomachache!

479
00:42:56,800 --> 00:43:00,400
I need to go to the latrine...

480
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:11,200
I'll be right back, my dear...

481
00:43:18,800 --> 00:43:21,400
Five Fortunes!

482
00:43:29,800 --> 00:43:33,800
-How's everything?
-It's going smoothly as planned

483
00:43:33,800 --> 00:43:35,800
-Where's Fuqi-ge?
-He's out

484
00:43:36,800 --> 00:43:39,800
Let's go.
That dirty old man will soon be back

485
00:43:48,800 --> 00:43:50,800
Blow the candles out

486
00:43:52,800 --> 00:43:54,800
What! Shuangxi is
marrying Shi Yaoqian?

487
00:43:56,800 --> 00:44:01,400
Come back!
Relax, nothing will happen to her

488
00:44:01,800 --> 00:44:04,800
That scoundrel has got her, you know!

489
00:44:04,800 --> 00:44:07,800
-This is part of my plan!
-What!

490
00:44:07,800 --> 00:44:09,800
The aim is to get you out

491
00:44:09,800 --> 00:44:12,400
I'd rather die in the prison...

492
00:44:12,400 --> 00:44:16,400
than let a woman throw herself
at another man to save me!

493
00:44:19,800 --> 00:44:22,800
If you want a fight,
I'll take you on!

494
